{
	"_about": [
		"Who owns which file in the Vector Explorer enrichment wave, read by selftest/test_lanes.py.",
		"owns: the paths a lane alone may change after the day-0 commit (a trailing /** covers a folder). new: owned paths that did not exist on the day-0 commit.",
		"day0: every path the day-0 commit (the frozen contract, every placeholder mounted in its host, the pass-throughs, stubs and fixtures) added or changed.",
		"backlog: every file the enrichment backlog names; each is owned by exactly one lane.",
		"A lane diff is checked with: python3 scripts/acceptance/vector-explorer/selftest/test_lanes.py diff <lane> <day-0 commit> <lane tip>; every lane at once with diff-all.",
		"day0_commit: the commit every lane branches from (test_lanes.py day0 checks owns/new against it). merge_order: the order the lanes merge into vx/integration, the acceptance lane last (it regenerates the live wire fixtures over every other lane)."
	],
